@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Proposed quality scenarios and required evidence
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Source quality obligations\nAccepted behavior / proposed targets / actual constraints" as S
rectangle "QA-01 Access\nQA-03 Integrity" as A
rectangle "QA-02 Performance / capacity\nQA-04 Degradation" as P
rectangle "QA-05 Usability / accessibility\nQA-07 Maintainable change" as U
rectangle "QA-06 Recovery\nCurrent authority + external effects" as R
rectangle "Mechanisms and cross-attribute consequences\nComponent / runtime / data / deployment owners" as M
rectangle "Actual evidence and scoped disposition\nCorrectness, measurements, limits and unresolved gates" as E
S --> A
S --> P
S --> U
S --> R
A --> M
P --> M
U --> M
R --> M
M --> E
note bottom of E
 Proposed targets are not accepted promises.
 Diagram coverage is not executed verification.
end note
@enduml
